# Normalize to LF in the repo, check out per-platform.
# Without this, git rewrites every file to CRLF on the Windows working tree and
# diffs get noisy the moment a file is edited on a different OS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts: never line-ending translated, never diffed.
*.gguf binary
*.safetensors binary
*.bin binary
*.parquet binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary

# Lockfiles are generated by npm/uv; keep them LF so hashes stay stable.
package-lock.json -diff
uv.lock -diff